#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# $File: frameassembly,v 1.0 2026/11/01 18:00:00 steve Exp $
# FrameAssembly network packet specification (.fasm)
# URL: https://github.com/SteveWinschel/FrameAssembly
# Reference: https://github.com/SteveWinschel/FrameAssembly/blob/main/docs/fasm-specification.md
#
# Upstream Submission Guide for file(1) / libmagic (https://github.com/file/file):
#   1. Clone https://github.com/file/file
#   2. Place this file as magic/Magdir/frameassembly
#   3. Test compilation: file -C -m magic/Magdir/frameassembly
#   4. Run test suite: make check
#   5. Submit patch via pull request at https://github.com/file/file or email to christos@zoulas.com
#
# Local System Installation:
#   User:   cat contrib/magic/frameassembly.magic >> ~/.magic
#   System: sudo cp contrib/magic/frameassembly.magic /etc/magic.d/frameassembly (or /etc/magic)
#   Verify: file -m contrib/magic/frameassembly.magic demo.fasm
#           file -i -m contrib/magic/frameassembly.magic demo.fasm
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# FrameAssembly documents contain top-level HOST { IP ... }, FLOW(...) { ... }, and COMPILE { ... } blocks.
# The rules below match within initial byte search windows to tolerate license banners and comments.

0	search/2048/cC	HOST
>0	search/1024/cC	IP
>>0	search/4096/cC	FLOW
>>>0	search/8192/cC	COMPILE	FrameAssembly network packet specification
!:mime	text/vnd.frameassembly
!:ext	fasm

0	search/2048/cC	FLOW
>0	search/4096/cC	HOST
>>0	search/1024/cC	IP
>>>0	search/8192/cC	COMPILE	FrameAssembly network packet specification
!:mime	text/vnd.frameassembly
!:ext	fasm
